THERE IS NO AUDIO IN THIS WORK
------------------------------

This repository contains no music, no sound effects and no recorded voice, and
the site plays none. Everything above is text, code and drawing.

Earlier versions carried nine cues and two beds from a subscription library.
The library was asked whether its licence covered that use in a freely
published, openly licensed educational site and said it did not, so the files
were removed from the working tree and purged from this repository's history.
Nothing of them remains to be licensed, forked or redistributed.

The site's read-aloud uses the browser's own speech synthesiser. It plays no
file, ships no recording, and is covered by the code licence like any other
function.

